      "id": "copilot-1786758116848-0",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-08-15",
      "text": "This page lists the latest features and improvements for Microsoft 365 Copilot. It includes changes that are generally available (Current Channel for Microsoft 365 apps) and specific to each platform.",
      "severity": "info",
      "severityLabel": "Info",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1786758116848-1",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-08-15",
      "text": "Copilot features are introduced using a safe deployment model, gradually rolling out to a subset of users within a tenant before expanding across the organization.",
      "severity": "info",
      "severityLabel": "Info",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1786758116848-2",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-08-15",
      "text": "Copilot connectors now run content crawl and identity crawl in parallel, making ingested content available to users faster than before.",
      "severity": "low",
      "severityLabel": "Miglioramento",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1786758116849-3",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-08-15",
      "text": "What changed: Previously, content crawl and identity crawl executed sequentially, causing delays before content became accessible in Copilot. Now, both crawls run in parallel, reducing total processing time. This change improves content freshness and availability without compromising security or per",
      "severity": "low",
      "severityLabel": "Miglioramento",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1786758116849-4",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-08-15",
      "text": "Faster ingestion of new and updated content",
      "severity": "low",
      "severityLabel": "Miglioramento",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1786758116849-5",
